  "description": "They called him a fool, but Princess Pyeonggang just found the prize of the kingdom. To avoid a political marriage, Pyeonggang seeks out On Dal, only to find a well-built, handsome man who is anything but slow. With a secret hidden beneath his rough exterior and a \"private matter\" that demands her personal attention, the Princess is about to learn that some legends are better left uncorrected.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
